{"id":"ai-limits-bias-privacy","title":"AI: limits, bias and privacy","subject":"AI prompting","label":"AI prompting","exams":[],"language":"en","seconds":177,"duration":177.24,"audio":"voice.mp3","words":488,"sections":[{"id":"hook","title":"Start","start":0,"end":15.445},{"id":"explain","title":"Bias and privacy","start":15.445,"end":57.395},{"id":"explain2","title":"Fakes and honesty","start":57.395,"end":96.195},{"id":"example","title":"Worked example","start":96.195,"end":113.845},{"id":"check","title":"Quick check","start":113.845,"end":125.525},{"id":"answer","title":"Answer","start":125.525,"end":134.215},{"id":"mistakes","title":"Common mistakes","start":134.215,"end":155.595},{"id":"recap","title":"Recap","start":155.595,"end":177.24}],"lines":[{"s":0,"a":0.5,"b":1.12,"text":"I'm Kora.","w":[0.56,0.72]},{"s":0,"a":1.42,"b":4.84,"text":"Imagine you ask AI for a picture of a doctor and a nurse.","w":[1.5,1.92,2.16,2.46,2.9,3.08,3.16,3.5,3.62,3.7,4.18,4.3,4.38]},{"s":0,"a":5.14,"b":8.21,"text":"Every doctor comes out as a man, every nurse as a woman.","w":[5.22,5.46,5.84,6.12,6.26,6.38,6.44,7.2,7.42,7.7,7.82,7.9]},{"s":0,"a":8.51,"b":11.9,"text":"Is that the truth, or is it a pattern copied from people's data?","w":[8.58,8.7,8.9,9.02,9.74,9.88,10,10.1,10.18,10.6,11.02,11.2,11.54]},{"s":0,"a":12.35,"b":15.02,"text":"Today we look at limits, bias and privacy.","w":[12.4,12.78,12.94,13.18,13.32,13.82,14.34,14.52]},{"s":1,"a":15.87,"b":18.96,"text":"AI models learn from text and images made by people.","w":[15.98,16.3,16.68,16.92,17.16,17.56,17.72,18.16,18.38,18.58]},{"s":1,"a":19.26,"b":21.66,"text":"So they can repeat the biases in that data.","w":[19.3,19.44,19.6,19.78,20.18,20.3,21,21.12,21.32]},{"s":1,"a":21.96,"b":24.68,"text":"A bias is a slant that treats some people unfairly.","w":[22.02,22.12,22.54,22.68,22.78,23.1,23.28,23.56,23.76,24.16]},{"s":1,"a":24.98,"b":30.17,"text":"Those biases can show up as stereotypes about gender, race, nationality or religion.","w":[25,25.34,25.88,26.08,26.32,26.46,26.58,27.34,27.6,28.3,28.9,29.64,29.78]},{"s":1,"a":30.47,"b":35.51,"text":"The models often know more about rich countries and widely used languages than about others.","w":[30.52,30.64,31.2,31.48,31.72,32,32.3,32.56,33.26,33.44,33.9,34.12,34.66,34.82,35.12]},{"s":1,"a":35.81,"b":39.9,"text":"So question answers about people and groups. Ask for other points of view.","w":[35.88,36.22,36.62,36.96,37.2,37.54,37.64,38.64,38.88,39.04,39.26,39.52,39.62]},{"s":1,"a":40.2,"b":41.16,"text":"Now privacy.","w":[40.3,40.7]},{"s":1,"a":41.46,"b":42.9,"text":"What you type may be stored.","w":[41.52,41.68,41.84,42.14,42.3,42.46]},{"s":1,"a":43.2,"b":48.51,"text":"Depending on the service and its settings, it may be used to improve the system, or seen by staff.","w":[43.24,43.72,43.82,43.98,44.48,44.6,44.76,45.52,45.64,45.84,46.04,46.22,46.34,46.68,46.8,47.54,47.74,48,48.2]},{"s":1,"a":48.81,"b":56.97,"text":"So never share passwords, bank or identity details, health information, or other people's private information and photos. Check the settings.","w":[48.88,49.1,49.4,49.66,50.64,51.14,51.3,51.74,52.58,52.84,53.46,53.64,53.84,54.22,54.56,55.08,55.2,56.1,56.36,56.48]},{"s":2,"a":57.82,"b":62.28,"text":"AI can now make realistic fake pictures, voices and videos.","w":[57.94,58.46,58.64,58.92,59.18,59.82,60.08,61.02,61.58,61.7]},{"s":2,"a":62.58,"b":64.11,"text":"These are called deepfakes.","w":[62.62,62.88,63.02,63.34]},{"s":2,"a":64.41,"b":66.95,"text":"It can also write convincing scam messages.","w":[64.48,64.56,64.8,65.1,65.38,66.04,66.36]},{"s":2,"a":67.25,"b":70.99,"text":"Before you share a shocking picture or clip, check where it came from.","w":[67.28,67.6,67.76,68.04,68.16,68.6,69.06,69.2,69.86,70.1,70.3,70.4,70.66]},{"s":2,"a":71.29,"b":72.69,"text":"Look for a trusted source.","w":[71.32,71.54,71.7,71.8,72.22]},{"s":2,"a":72.99,"b":74.62,"text":"Honesty and ownership matter too.","w":[73,73.48,73.64,74.04,74.32]},{"s":2,"a":74.92,"b":78.89,"text":"Say when work was made with AI where your school or employer requires it.","w":[75.06,75.3,75.48,75.74,75.92,76.16,76.34,76.76,76.94,77.14,77.58,77.72,78.22,78.78]},{"s":2,"a":79.19,"b":85.83,"text":"AI output can copy from existing work, and the law on who owns content made by AI differs between countries.","w":[79.32,79.74,80.14,80.36,80.72,80.9,81.36,82.08,82.2,82.34,82.68,82.8,83.06,83.3,83.8,84.02,84.3,84.74,85.06,85.38]},{"s":2,"a":86.13,"b":88.91,"text":"Also, skills you never practise, you lose.","w":[86.18,86.76,87.1,87.28,87.58,88.32,88.52]},{"s":2,"a":89.21,"b":93.71,"text":"For decisions about health, law or money, AI is a starting point.","w":[89.26,89.44,89.9,90.16,90.92,91.64,91.82,92.56,92.94,93.06,93.14,93.48]},{"s":2,"a":94.01,"b":95.77,"text":"A qualified person decides.","w":[94.06,94.18,94.8,95.18]},{"s":3,"a":96.62,"b":99.15,"text":"You ask for a picture of a doctor and a nurse.","w":[96.66,96.92,97.14,97.3,97.38,97.86,97.96,98.04,98.54,98.66,98.74]},{"s":3,"a":99.45,"b":102.26,"text":"Every doctor is a man and every nurse is a woman.","w":[99.52,99.8,100.18,100.3,100.38,101.02,101.28,101.54,101.8,101.92,101.98]},{"s":3,"a":102.56,"b":103.72,"text":"You notice the bias.","w":[102.58,102.76,103.08,103.18]},{"s":3,"a":104.02,"b":105.89,"text":"You ask again for a mix of people.","w":[104.06,104.32,104.56,104.94,105.1,105.18,105.42,105.52]},{"s":3,"a":106.19,"b":109.06,"text":"The new picture shows men and women in both roles.","w":[106.22,106.36,106.54,106.96,107.28,107.6,107.76,108.1,108.26,108.58]},{"s":3,"a":109.36,"b":113.42,"text":"That is how you handle bias: notice it, then ask again.","w":[109.44,109.78,109.9,110.08,110.26,110.58,111.58,111.98,112.4,112.74,113]},{"s":4,"a":114.27,"b":114.89,"text":"Quick check.","w":[114.32,114.56]},{"s":4,"a":115.19,"b":119.82,"text":"A friend sends you a voice note that sounds like a relative asking for money urgently.","w":[115.26,115.38,115.74,115.98,116.14,116.22,116.54,116.78,117,117.32,117.5,117.58,118.36,118.72,118.9,119.28]},{"s":4,"a":120.12,"b":122.15,"text":"What should you do before sending anything?","w":[120.14,120.34,120.54,120.68,120.94,121.28,121.68]},{"s":4,"a":122.6,"b":125.1,"text":"Pause here and try it. I'll wait.","w":[122.64,123,123.3,123.48,123.8,124.52,124.72]},{"s":5,"a":125.95,"b":133.79,"text":"Stop, and check by calling the relative on a number you already know. A scam can copy a voice, so verify on a number you trust.","w":[126.04,126.84,127,127.26,127.44,127.78,127.88,128.4,128.5,128.6,128.86,129.06,129.36,130.26,130.36,130.74,130.9,131.22,131.28,132.02,132.24,132.78,132.88,132.96,133.22,133.38]},{"s":6,"a":134.64,"b":135.65,"text":"Common mistakes.","w":[134.7,135.06]},{"s":6,"a":135.95,"b":139.75,"text":"First, treating AI as neutral, or letting it decide instead of advise.","w":[135.98,136.3,136.72,137.1,137.24,137.8,137.94,138.24,138.34,138.8,139.12,139.22]},{"s":6,"a":140.05,"b":142.37,"text":"Question it, and keep human judgement.","w":[140.1,140.54,141.08,141.24,141.5,141.84]},{"s":6,"a":142.67,"b":145.17,"text":"Second, pasting private data into a chat.","w":[142.78,143.42,143.88,144.22,144.58,144.82,144.9]},{"s":6,"a":145.47,"b":149.94,"text":"Never share passwords or other people's photos. Check the settings first.","w":[145.62,146,146.28,147.02,147.24,147.44,147.78,148.72,148.98,149.1,149.48]},{"s":6,"a":150.24,"b":152.96,"text":"Third, sharing AI pictures as real.","w":[150.36,151.08,151.54,151.86,152.4,152.6]},{"s":6,"a":153.26,"b":155.17,"text":"Check the source before you pass it on.","w":[153.34,153.6,153.76,154.12,154.42,154.56,154.84,155]},{"s":7,"a":156.02,"b":156.57,"text":"Recap.","w":[156.08]},{"s":7,"a":156.87,"b":161.23,"text":"AI can repeat bias from people's data, so question answers about groups.","w":[157,157.38,157.54,157.94,158.3,158.46,158.82,159.54,159.72,160.18,160.5,160.74]},{"s":7,"a":161.53,"b":165.07,"text":"Protect privacy, because what you type may be stored or seen.","w":[161.54,162,162.94,163.22,163.38,163.52,163.82,163.98,164.14,164.54,164.7]},{"s":7,"a":165.37,"b":169.84,"text":"Check deepfakes and scams before sharing, and say when AI helped with work.","w":[165.38,165.68,166.26,166.4,166.82,167.12,167.96,168.12,168.34,168.66,169.1,169.36,169.52]},{"s":7,"a":170.14,"b":174.06,"text":"Top tip: use AI as a starting point, not the final word.","w":[170.18,170.5,171.24,171.54,171.9,172.04,172.12,172.48,173.1,173.32,173.46,173.78]},{"s":7,"a":174.36,"b":176.64,"text":"Knowzone is here to help you learn safely.","w":[174.46,175.02,175.14,175.38,175.52,175.72,175.88,176.18]}],"scenes":[{"at":0.25,"heading":"AI: limits, bias, privacy","items":[{"at":1.32,"kind":"text","text":"Ask AI: picture of a doctor and a nurse"},{"at":5.04,"kind":"text","text":"Every doctor = man; every nurse = woman"},{"at":8.41,"kind":"text","text":"Truth or copied pattern from data?"},{"at":12.25,"kind":"text","text":"Today: limits, bias, privacy"}]},{"at":15.62,"heading":"Bias","items":[{"at":15.77,"kind":"text","text":"AI learns from people's text and images"},{"at":19.16,"kind":"text","text":"Can repeat biases in that data"},{"at":21.86,"kind":"term","text":"Bias","detail":"A slant that treats some people unfairly"},{"at":24.88,"kind":"text","text":"Stereotypes: gender, race, nationality, religion"}]},{"at":30.22,"heading":"Bias & privacy","items":[{"at":30.37,"kind":"text","text":"More data on rich countries and widely used languages"},{"at":35.71,"kind":"tip","text":"Question answers about groups; ask for other views"},{"at":41.36,"kind":"text","text":"What you type may be stored"},{"at":43.1,"kind":"text","text":"May be used to improve the system, or seen by staff"},{"at":48.71,"kind":"tip","text":"Never share passwords, bank/ID, health, private info/photos; check settings"}]},{"at":57.57,"heading":"Fakes","items":[{"at":57.72,"kind":"text","text":"AI makes realistic fake pictures, voices, videos"},{"at":62.48,"kind":"term","text":"Deepfakes","detail":"Realistic fake pictures, voices or videos made by AI"},{"at":64.31,"kind":"text","text":"AI can write convincing scam messages"},{"at":67.15,"kind":"tip","text":"Before sharing a shocking picture/clip, check source"},{"at":71.19,"kind":"text","text":"Look for a trusted source"}]},{"at":72.74,"heading":"Honesty & ownership","items":[{"at":74.82,"kind":"text","text":"Say when work was made with AI if required"},{"at":79.09,"kind":"text","text":"AI output can copy existing work; ownership law varies"},{"at":86.03,"kind":"text","text":"Skills you never practise, you lose"},{"at":89.11,"kind":"text","text":"For health, law or money, AI is a starting point"},{"at":93.91,"kind":"text","text":"A qualified person decides"}]},{"at":96.37,"heading":"Worked example","items":[{"at":96.52,"kind":"text","text":"Ask for a picture of a doctor and a nurse"},{"at":99.35,"kind":"text","text":"Every doctor = man; every nurse = woman"},{"at":102.46,"kind":"text","text":"Notice the bias"}]},{"at":103.77,"heading":"Worked example (2)","items":[{"at":103.92,"kind":"text","text":"Ask again for a mix of people"},{"at":106.09,"kind":"text","text":"New picture: men and women in both roles"},{"at":109.26,"kind":"text","text":"Handle bias: notice it, then ask again"}]},{"at":113.84,"heading":"Quick check","items":[{"at":113.84,"kind":"question","text":"A friend sends you a voice note that sounds like a relative asking for money urgently. What should you do before sending anything?"}]},{"at":125.7,"heading":"Answer","items":[{"at":125.85,"kind":"text","text":"Stop; verify"},{"at":125.85,"kind":"tip","text":"Call relative on a known number; a scam can copy a voice"}]},{"at":134.39,"heading":"Common mistakes","items":[{"at":135.85,"kind":"wrong","text":"Treating AI as neutral / letting it decide"},{"at":142.57,"kind":"wrong","text":"Pasting private data into a chat"}]},{"at":149.99,"heading":"Common mistakes (2)","items":[{"at":150.14,"kind":"wrong","text":"Sharing AI pictures as real"}]},{"at":155.77,"heading":"Recap","items":[{"at":156.77,"kind":"text","text":"AI can repeat bias from data; question group answers"},{"at":161.43,"kind":"text","text":"Protect privacy: what you type may be stored or seen"},{"at":165.27,"kind":"text","text":"Check deepfakes/scams before sharing; say when AI helped"},{"at":170.04,"kind":"tip","text":"Use AI as a starting point, not the final word"},{"at":174.26,"kind":"text","text":"Knowzone: learn safely"}]}],"check":{"at":125.35,"seconds":10,"question":"A friend sends you a voice note that sounds like a relative asking for money urgently. What should you do before sending anything?","answer":"Stop; call the relative on a number you already know. A scam can copy a voice, so verify on a trusted number."},"fps":30,"mouth":"","level":"","credits":[],"voice":"qwen3-tts-12hz-1.7b (cloned voice)"}